9031554_1057237769326425_2363224287171852583_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=I-nu72i8yBUQ7kNvwEWmDuZ&_nc_oc=AdoyKYdjUmmzEjvts03i8J-msMTA3YZeadtQrAQCSRswJvdOeXcvBBMs3e9nL-n6IYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3bO83SrTet5HHBtmocOten0zH2QVqzrtw5E0H-OMHntA&oe=69DCE0E6"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1488377815132033", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001670_1488377818465366_4369730771137685134_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cXa5Bm21Fo8Q7kNvwGqZdnk&_nc_oc=Adqrl4jrZfoHAZGczO_VnqR8L60PlTbkFVJ2McwY6eYqE-D94Iape27CugGAx4J8whY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0oJwd6kKgsnSCC_Gv2Wm1ozUw4bI_mYH3R3efOQ2G73w&oe=69DCDD44"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "414882827722865", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982480_414882831056198_2207792374391745331_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Lq2sjqI6UUsQ7kNvwFWWmxq&_nc_oc=Adpfv4uhsQ-XtzhOoQ095dK5Sg7JgjHkhFEyUUj1sgGaiSRtINr_G6N8Usru0MATD0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0AF6wrbEsK_1PW1kW2QDXCbAGk_h-jpuLSiP_2f_IKnw&oe=69DCD07D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "16x9-2.png", "id": "811607170639171", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86609236_811607173972504_8101196321901847264_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9a7zx6PsRBoQ7kNvwEAb1kM&_nc_oc=AdpfjLMWGIoHGH_JfW3FnAvURkdxrC73VLglFIN0ewuNT1m11SRiZg3bW7pXqwKnZ6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0dTx2U_73jlvwAoB7yKcii1HPUxegTV2Ov03LfMI1rWA&oe=69DCFD81"}, "display_name": "Void Ninja Demo", "keywords": ["action", "platformer", "ninja", "void", "runner"], "long_description": "Void Ninja is an **action platformer** game that blends runner elements with a unique **\u201cJinba Ittai\u201d locomotion**.  \n\n\ud83d\udc49Gameplay: You're **always on the move and can't stop**. Use your hips and shoulders to steer on the path. Overcome obstacles and clear out enemies.   \n\n\ud83d\udc49**Just one button \u2014 let your body do the rest!*** \nYou don't need to remember million of combinations, or press something to move  - run with the flow.  \n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77  \n\n# Key Features:\n\n- **Unique natural flow locomotion:**   \nInspired by the \"Jinba Ittai\" philosophy, this system ensures perfect unity between player and the game - you simply act as you would in real life  \n\u2796  \n- **Comfort / Motion sickness tested:**  \n 85% of players experienced no symptoms, 10% adapted after 30 minutes, and 5% did not adjust and we prefer not to talk about them  \n\u2796 \n- **Platformer / runner:**   \nFirst-person platforming adventure inspired by a certain blue hedgehog. Intense combats,  adrenaline-pumping jumps and jet-powered flights - this game will keep your heart racing   \n \u2796 \n- **Combat dance:**   \nAs you progress, you'll develop your own unique moves and combos crafted by your skill, not pre-made by the developers  \n \u2796\n- **Level reassembly:**   \nEach time you load a level, it\u2019s generated in a new and unique way   \n\n\n\n\ud83e\udea7**4 demo levels**   \n\u279517 extra levesl available in the paid supporter version\n\n\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd77 \n\nThis is work in progress version.\n**Share your thoughts, ideas and feedback with us** - let's make the game together.\n\n*rarely its 2 buttons, but you won't confuse them. Only 1 sounds better, right?\n", "short_description": "Action platformer with gesture based controls and unique locomotion."}]}, "developer_name": "Roman Yakimenko", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://void-ninja.com/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Magic Web Solutions", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://void-ninja.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_categ